<title>PERU: Peru's Minsur 6-mo net rises.</title>
<headline>Peru's Minsur 6-mo net rises.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share - N.A.</p>
<p>Net - 66.6 million soles vs 59.2 million soles</p>
<p>Revs - 207.7 million soles vs 158.8 million soles</p>
<p>NOTE: Minsur SA, Peru's only tin miner, is the world's third largest tin producer. The company operates the San Rafael mine in Peru's southern highlands.</p>
<p>((-- Eduardo Orozco, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
</text>
